{"id":"vod_sn_36046","vodId":"36046","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"迷途猫OVER RUN","name_cn":"迷途猫OVER RUN","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/70a8a4ef29b4f71d6f89fc96ea32d3f2.jpg"},"summary":"没有血缘关系的都筑巧（冈本信彦 配音）和都筑乙女（佐藤聪美 配音）经营着一家生意惨淡的西点店“stray cats”，乙女天然呆和什么东西都喜欢往家捡的个性让巧十分头痛，同时，她制作糕点的技术和经营管理店面的技巧也给本身就岌岌可危的西点店雪上加霜。但是，在亲梅竹马泽文琴乃（伊藤加奈惠 配音）的帮助下，巧的日常还算是风平浪静。　　一切都在这一天发生了翻天覆地的变化，乙女居然捡回了一只外表怎么看都像是傲娇少女的“流浪猫”！“猫”的名字叫做雾谷希（竹达彩奈 配音），本来大叫着“丢掉她”的巧，却折服在了希在蛋糕制作方面的惊人手艺之下而将其留下帮忙。就这样，在一群损友的陪伴下，巧与流浪猫的快乐生活开始了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:39:54","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6p2xJvW0rS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eZ2tRdtYt91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Jpx3pPxZ0p1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7LBJ7cK4f01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pvXgWtZJ8z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mZ7A0DEzMk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4bh0ndZYSS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DaQPv3aFma1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AZFRLCXWSJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QwNG6FC6Jr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Wn125w63e11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/V1Hv1Xmtmf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fx14PbzuwX1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:27.514Z"}